--[[
	Libary.lua
	A modern dark-themed UI library for Roblox script executors.

	- Built with a DOM-style "create -> style -> append" approach (like web development)
	- CSS-like theme tokens, hover states and tweened transitions
	- Left-side text tab rail with section captions
	- Two-column section system with captions
	- Procedural vector icons (no external image assets required)
	- Drag / resize / minimize / hide + search bar with a "/" hotkey

	Usage: see Example.lua
]]

